  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yosefu yaalagira omugheereza we ati: “Ta mu nsawo dh'abasaadha abo emere yoonayoona ye baghanga okwetwika, era ote empiiya dha buli muntu ku munwa gw'ensawo ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ta n'ekikopo kyange ekya feeza ku munwa gw'ensawo ey'oyo asembayo obuto, era oteemu n'empiiya dhe dh'aguziiza engaano.” Omugheereza yaakola nga Yosefu bw'amukobye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe bwakya enkyo, aboluganda baasiibulwa nga bali n'endogoyi dhaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baali baakatambulaku katono okuva mu kibuga, Yosefu yaakoba omugheereza we ati: “Situka obingirire abasaadha abo. Bw'onaabatuukaku, obakobe oti, ‘Lwaki ebirungi bye tubakoleire mubisaswiremu ebibi? Lwaki mwibye ekikopo kya musengwa wange ekya feeza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekikopo ekyo musengwa wange ni ky'anhweramu era ni ky'akozesa ng'alagula. Kye mukoze kibi inho!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugheereza bweyabatuukaku yaabakoba ebibono ebyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bairamu bati: “Isebo, kiki ekikwogeza ebibono ebiri ng'oti n'ebyo? Ife abagheereza bo titusobola kukola kintu kiri ng'oti n'ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oidhi bukalamu oti empiiya dhe twayagaana ku minwa gy'ensawo dhaife twadhikwiriza nga tuva mu nsi ey'e Kanaani. Kale twandiibye tutya feeza oba zaabu mu ndhu ya musengwa wo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isebo, oyo yeenayeena, ku ife abagheereza bo, anaayagaanibwa nga n'ali nakyo, anaitibwa. Era n'ife abasigairegho tunaaba bairu bo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakoba ati: “Kale kibe kityo nga bwe mukobye. Aye oyo anaayagaanibwa nakyo, n'anaaba omwiru wange imwe abandi timuubeeku musango.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baatwikula mangu ensawo dhaibwe, baadhiisa ghansi, buli muntu yaasibula ensawo ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugheereza wa Yosefu yaaja ng'ayaza n'obwegendereza, ng'asookera ku asinga obukulu, yaamalira ku asembayo obuto. Yaayagaana ekikopo mu nsawo ya Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho aboluganda baakanulamu ebivaalo byaibwe olw'okunakughala, buli muntu yaatwika ebintu ku ndogoyi ye, bairayo mu kibuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda ni baganda be bwe baatuuka mu ndhu ya Yosefu, baayagaana ng'akaalimu, baakuba amakiryaivu mu maiso ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yaababuuza ati: “Kiki kino kye mukoze? Timwidhi muti omuntu ali mu kifo ng'oti n'ekyange aghanga okuzuula ebyama by'abantu ng'alagula?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda yaakoba ati: “Tunaakukoba ki musengwa? Tunaayogera ki? Oba tunaawoza tutya? Katonda ayoleike nga gutusinze. Mpegaano tuli bairu bo, musengwa, ife era n'oyo ayagaaniibwa n'ekikopo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Yosefu yaakoba ati: “Busa! Tisobola kukola kintu kiri ng'oti n'ekyo. Oyo yenka ayagaaniibwa n'ekikopo, n'anaaba omwiru wange. Aye imwe abandi mwireyo bwera eri iseimwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yuda yaaja aghali Yosefu, yaakoba ati: “Musengwa wange, nkweghembye nganha, nze omwiru wo ndhogereku n'iwe. Otansungughalira, kuba oli ng'oti ni kyabazinga mwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa wange, watubuuza ife abairu bo oti, ‘Muliyooku n'iseimwe oba muganda waimwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twakwiramu tuti, ‘Tuliyo n'iseife era nga mukaire, ni muganda waife omuto, eyazaalibwa nga iseife akairiighe. Muganda w'omwana oyo yafa, era oyo ni yenka asigairegho ku baana ba inhina, era ise amwenda inho.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho, iwe waatukoba ife abairu bo oti, ‘Mumundeetere mmuboneku.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ife twakukoba, iwe musengwa wange, tuti, ‘Omwisuka tasobola kuva ghali ise, kuba bw'amuvaaku, ise aja kufa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe waatukoba, ife abairu bo, oti, ‘Muganda waimwe asembayo obuto bw'ataliidha ghalala n'imwe, timwirangayo kwidha mu maiso gange kabiri.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwe twairayo eri omugheereza wo iseife, twamukobera bye watukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho iseife oyo yaakoba ati: ‘Mwireyo mutugulireyo ku kamere.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ife twamwiramu tuti: “Titughanga kuja, kuba tibaja kutuganha kuja mu maiso ga musaadha ole, okutoolaku nga muganda waife oyo asembayo obuto ali ghalala n'ife. Aye muganda waife asembayo obuto bw'anaaja n'ife, agho tunaaja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseife oyo, omugheereza wo, yaatukoba ati: “Mwidhi nga mukazi wange Rakeli yanzaalira abaana abalenzi babiri bonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owundi yanvaaku, naakoba nti: oyo bwenebwene ensolo ey'omu nsiko yamukankanula. Kuba era tiirangayo kumubonaku okuva lwe yanvaaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe munantoolaku n'ono, memale akabi ni kamutuukaku, muliba mundeeteire obughafu obulindhita nze omukaire ati.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale, olw'okuba obulamu bwa iseife buli ghalala inho n'obw'omwisuka oyo, bwe ndiirayo eri iseife nga omwisuka tali ninze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olulituuka tuti, iseife n'abona ng'omwisuka tali n'ife, aja kufa bufe. Olwo ife abagheereza bo tuliba nga tuleeteire iseife omukaire atyo obughafu obulimwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate era nze omugheereza wo neeyama eri lata wange, okukuuma omwisuka oyo, nga nkoba nti, ‘Bwe ntalimwiza y'oli, omusango gubanga ku nze enaku dhoonadhoona edh'obulamu bwange.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni musengwa wange, nkweghembye, nganha nze nsigale ghano nga ndi mwiru wo, mu kifo ky'omwisuka aye oleke omwisuka aireyo ni baganda be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba ndituuka ntya eri lata wange, nga omwisuka tali ninze? Tisobola kuguma kubona akabi akalituuka ku lata wange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
